# The card-sandbox bootstrap's build output.
#
# It lives under `public/` because that is the one directory Vite serves
# byte-for-byte: emitted anywhere else inside the project root, a dev-time fetch
# comes back transformed into an ES module, which is a parse error in the classic
# script it gets injected into — and a parse error cannot be reported by the
# script that failed to parse. `npm run build` builds it before the app so the
# copy into `dist/` is never stale.
public/sandbox/
